 to classic Mario style games, where you control a character jumping through levels filled with obstacles and enemies.\r\n    </div>\r\n    <div class=\"paragraph center\">\r\n        <iframe class=\"youtube\" src=\"https://www.youtube.com/embed/cDJvXUEzFbQ\" frameborder=\"0\" allowfullscreen></iframe>\r\n    </div>\r\n   \r\n\r\n    <div class=\"paragraph\">\r\n        Main features :\r\n        <ul>\r\n        <li>Multiple handmade tilemap levels that get progressively harder</li>\r\n        <li>Idle, moving, jumping, death and climbing animations</li>\r\n        <li>Enemy AI</li>\r\n        <li>Fluid player movement</li>\r\n        <li>Custom music</li>\r\n        <li>Sounds effects</li>\r\n        <li>Rotating death and level transition screens</li>\r\n        </ul>\r\n    </div>\r\n\r\n    <div class=\"paragraph center\">\r\n        <img class=\"phone-screenshot\" src=\"https://i.imgur.com/TW6bHvp.png\" alt=\"JumpShot!\" />\r\n        <img class=\"phone-screenshot\" src=\"https://i.imgur.com/8MkrYLJ.png\" alt=\"JumpShot!\" />\r\n    </div>\r\n    `, \"#303030\", false, true),\r\n    new ProjectData(\"project-2\", \"Timber Town Prototype\", \"img/projects/timbertowncover.png\", `\r\n    <div class=\"paragraph\">\r\n        <strong>Timber Town</strong> is one of my passion projects. It's a lumber tycoon 2 inspired game with dynamic tree cutting and building mechanics. I would love to develop it further someday.'\r\n    </div>\r\n    <div class=\"paragraph center\">\r\n        <iframe class=\"youtube\" src=\"https://www.youtube.com/embed/kpt9KY2PfEk\" frameborder=\"0\" allowfullscreen></iframe>\r\n    </div>\r\n\r\n    <div class=\"paragraph\">\r\n        Main features :\r\n        <ul>\r\n        <li>Dynamic tree cutting where the tree cuts wherever you click</li>\r\n        <li>Third and first person camera with easy switching by pressing \"V\"</li>\r\n        <li>Portal/Half life like dragging and rotating of logs and items</li>\r\n        <li>Inventory system with dragging, hotbar and item swapping</li>\r\n        <li>Food, water and health systems. Food goes down over time, water goes down the more you move and health goes down when either of those are empty or you get hit</li>\r\n        <li>Ability to drag logs into sawmills and based on the volume of the log it gets turned into a plank.</li>\r\n        <li>Crosshair that tells you what item/tree your looking at</li>\r\n        </ul>\r\n    </div>\r\n\r\n    <div class=\"paragraph\">\r\n    </div>\r\n\r\n    <div class=\"paragraph center\">\r\n    <img class=\"pc-screenshot\" src=\"https://i.imgur.com/ZSczQCl.png\" alt=\"Singing Addict Screenshot\" />\r\n    <img class=\"pc-screenshot\" src=\"https://i.imgur.com/GzsmPHF.png\" alt=\"Singing Addict Screenshot\" />\r\n    </div>\r\n    `, \"#303030\"),\r\n    new ProjectData(\"project-3\", \"SnowFlipper\", \"img/projects/snowcover.PNG\", `\r\n    <div class=\"paragraph\">\r\n        <strong>SnowFlipper</strong> is a 2 side scrolling runner where you control a character flipping through snowy hills trying not to crash so you can get to the end.\r\n    </div>\r\n\r\n    <div class=\"paragraph\">\r\n        Main features :\r\n        <ul>\r\n        <li>Particle effects from riding, falling and passing the finish line</li>\r\n        <li>Momentum driven physics and movement</li>\r\n        <li>Level Transitioning</li>\r\n        <li>Sound effects for falling and finishing</li>\r\n        </ul>\r\n    </div>\r\n\r\n\r\n    </div>\r\n\r\n    <div class=\"paragraph center\">\r\n        <img class=\"pc-screenshot\" src=\"https://i.imgur.com/tcftzWt.png\" alt=\"Drawing Overload Screenshot\" />\r\n        <img class=\"pc-screenshot\" src=\"https://i.imgur.com/zXmyli4.png\" alt=\"Drawing Overload Screenshot\" />\r\n    </div>\r\n    `, \"#303030\"),\r\n    new ProjectData(\"project-4\", \"Delivery Dash\", \"img/projects/deliverydashcover.PNG\", `\r\n    <div class=\"paragraph\">\r\n    <strong>Delivery Dash</strong> is the first game i made.It's a simple top down delivery game where you have to pick up and deliver packages while avoiding obstacles.'\r\n    <div class=\"paragraph center\">\r\n        <iframe class=\"youtube\" src=\"https://www.youtube.com/embed/tKKg4iIT0nw\" frameborder=\"0\" allowfullscreen></iframe>\r\n    </div>\r\n    \r\n    <div class=\"paragraph\">\r\n        Main features :\r\n        <ul>\r\n        <li>Top down driving movement</li>\r\n        <li>Collisions</li>\r\n        <li>Camera movement with vehicle</li>\r\n        <li>Pickups & scoring</li>\r\n        </ul>\r\n    </div>\r\n\r\n\r\n    <div class=\"paragraph center\">\r\n        <img class=\"pc-screenshot\" src=\"https://i.imgur.com/bdTfx1A.png\" alt=\"Eugeneable Screenshot\" />\r\n        <img class=\"pc-screenshot\" src=\"https://i.imgur.com/xHPT6Q9.png\" alt=\"Eugeneable Screenshot\" />\r\n    </div>\r\n    `, \"#303030\"),\r\n    new ProjectData(\"project-5\", \"Star Wars: Star Fighter\", \"img/projects/starwarscover.PNG\", `\r\n    <div class=\"paragraph\">\r\n        <strong>Star Wars: Star Fighter</strong> is a top down galaga style mobile space shooter where you control a star fighter trying to survive waves of tie fighters.\r\n    <div class=\"paragraph center\">\r\n        <iframe class=\"youtube\" src=\"https://www.youtube.com/embed/UBGBoJE9868\" frameborder=\"0\" allowfullscreen></iframe>\r\n    </div>\r\n\r\n    <div class=\"paragraph\">\r\n        Main features :\r\n        <ul>\r\n        <li>Background music</li>\r\n        <li>Main menu with game starting, loading and exiting</li>\r\n        <li>Sound effects and VFX for shooting and explosions</li>\r\n        <li>Projectile and health systems</li>\r\n        <li>Enemy wave spawning</li>\r\n        <li>Score and highscore system</li>\r\n        </ul>\r\n    </div>\r\n\r\n    <div class=\"paragraph\">\r\n        <div class=\"notice\">\r\n        Windows build available on <a href=\"https://some.where/nice\" target=\"_blank\">itch.io</a>.\r\n        Source code available on <a href=\"https://github.com/yourself\" target=\"_blank\">GitHub</a>.\r\n        </div>\r\n    </div>\r\n\r\n    <div class=\"paragraph center\">\r\n        <img class=\"pc-screenshot\" src=\"https://i.imgur.com/5bp93ZU.png\" alt=\"Cloud Drew Land Screenshot\" />\r\n        <img class=\"pc-screenshot\" src=\"https://i.imgur.com/RiobhTE.png\" alt=\"Cloud Drew Land Screenshot\" />\r\n        <img class=\"pc-screenshot\" src=\"https://i.imgur.com/idAxiOs.png\" alt=\"Cloud Drew Land Screenshot\" />\r\n    </div>`, \"#303030\")\r\n];"]}]}